        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D24441 Victorian Rope Door Knob Entry Door Locksets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rope detailing on both the backplate and the knob of Omnia's Victorian Rope Door Knob Entry Lockset gives it a traditional feel that borders on the side of extravagant. It looks expensive and will add tasteful elegance to any front door. Made for doors 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches thick with backsets or 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/rope-door-knob-omnia-441-00\">Rope Knobset</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Rope Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit narrow stiles. For Door with a 2-3⁄8” backset, stile width can be as narrow as 3-5⁄8”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D24441 Rope Knob Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and knob latch): 3-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li></li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: \"T\" strike</li>\r\n<li>Each set contains door knobs, backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/entry-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262242\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Entry Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the handleset latch. The deadbolt is key operated from both the exterior ad the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Victorian Rope Door Knob Entry Lockset",
                "description": "Omnia D24441 Entry Door Lockset - The rope detailing on both the backplate and the knob of Omnia's Victorian Rope Door Knob Entry Lockset gives it a traditional feel that borders on the side of extravagant. It looks expensive and will add tasteful elegance to any front door. Made for doors 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches thick with backsets or 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
